1
00:00:00,326 --> 00:00:04,556
(Raj:)Okay, how about you just
dip your toe in and meet one of them?

2
00:00:06,032 --> 00:00:08,502
- Will you be there?
- Of course.

3
00:00:08,668 --> 00:00:11,968
(Lucy:)Well, that's two. Three if you count me.
This is getting out of hand.

4
00:00:14,841 --> 00:00:19,401
(Penny:)So then, during my afternoon shift,
I spilled an entire tray of drinks on myself.

5
00:00:19,579 --> 00:00:22,409
- Oh, that's awful.
- Not really. My shirt was soaking wet.

6
00:00:22,582 --> 00:00:24,812
(Penny:)I got, like, the biggest tip of my life.

7
00:00:27,487 --> 00:00:30,647
(Leonard:)So listen, do you remember
when I said the similarities...

8
00:00:30,823 --> 00:00:33,653
(Leonard:)...of the equations of general relativity
and hydrodynamics...

9
00:00:33,826 --> 00:00:38,196
(Leonard:)...suggest you could find the equivalent
of Unruh radiation in a large body of water?

10
00:00:38,998 --> 00:00:40,988
(Penny:)I thought I said that to you.

11
00:00:45,571 --> 00:00:50,941
(Leonard:)Anyway, Stephen Hawking's team is looking
into that, and I've been invited to join them.

12
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:53,600
(Penny:)Wow, Hawking. Good for you.

13
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:56,840
(Leonard:)Well, it is,
just, you know, I'd be gone for a while.

14
00:00:57,016 --> 00:00:59,176
- Well, how long?
- Three, four months.

